PRESENCE :literal 0

SPEC-TEST	missing	ghost*	declared, but the package does not define it
PRESENCE ghost* 1

SPEC-TEST	missing	quer?	declared, but the package does not define it
PRESENCE quer? 1
PRESENCE present* 0
PRESENCE ::present* 0
PRESENCE ::::present* 0
PRESENCE {bracket[one]} 0
PRESENCE {slash\name} 0
